# Milestone: v0.10.9-tag-state
# Covers: tag.frozen() / tag.blocked() getters + freeze/unfreeze/block/unblock
#         toggles + independent flag tracking.  Workspace-root compatibility-
#         decisions ledger §S6 ratifies the three cancellation modes.
# matrix-row: tag-freeze + tag-block + tag-frozen + tag-blocked
#
# Note: explicit-call syntax (.frozen() / .blocked() with parens) — full
# OPROPS property-style dispatch is OPROPS-deferred to v1.x per TAGCH-013.

var t = Tag.new()
t.frozen()
t.blocked()
t.freeze(); t.frozen()
t.blocked()
t.block(); t.blocked()
t.unfreeze(); t.frozen()
t.blocked()
t.unblock(); t.blocked()
[00000000] <Tag>
[00000001] false
[00000002] false
[00000003] true
[00000004] false
[00000005] true
[00000006] false
[00000007] true
[00000008] false
